# Components

One file per significant module or service. Give each a `covers:` frontmatter
listing the source paths it describes, so docs can be matched to code changes.

Example skeleton for a new component file:

```markdown
---
title: Billing
covers:
  - src/billing/**
related_adrs: []
last_synced: TODO-commit-sha
---

# Billing
Responsibility, key types, entry points, gotchas.
```
